# ===========================================================================
# PUBLICATION FIREWALL - DO NOT REMOVE, DO NOT NEGATE, DO NOT `git add -f`.
#
# This repository is published on GitHub. Nothing below may ever be committed,
# at any size, for any reason, including "just this once to fix a link".
#
#   docs/**   The governing specification, the internal companion, the
#             pre-registrations, the runbooks, and the certificate schema are
#             maintained OUTSIDE the published repository. They stay on the
#             working copy and are used locally; they are never distributed.
#
#   CLAUDE.md and every other AI-assistant artifact. These carry working
#             context, internal framing, and instructions that are not part of
#             the public product.
#
# Three independent mechanisms enforce this, because one is not enough:
#   1. these patterns
#   2. `sdip doctor`'s `publication-firewall` check
#   3. the `firewall` CI job, which fails the build on any tracked match
#
# `git add -f` defeats mechanism 1. It does not defeat 2 or 3. That is deliberate.
# ===========================================================================
docs/
local/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
.claude-session-sync.md
.cursor/
.aider*
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TEST DATA POLICY (spec 6.6) - binding.
# No proprietary or restricted data enters this repository, ever. Fixtures are
# synthetic-and-generated-by-committed-code, or openly licensed with provenance
# in tests/fixtures/PROVENANCE.md. Large open datasets are fetched at test time
# by checksum, never vendored. These patterns stop an accidental `git add`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.sgy
*.segy
*.SGY
*.SEGY
*.su
*.zgy
*.vds
*.sgz
!tests/fixtures/**/*.generated.sgy

# Generated stores and scratch output
*.mdio/
*.zarr/
/scratch/
/out/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RESTRICTED TEST DATA - local use only, never committed.
# SDIP is verified end to end against real survey data licensed for local use.
# The data lives OUTSIDE this repository; these patterns stop a copy, a symlink
# target, or anything derived from it being added by accident. Everything derived
# belongs in local/, which is itself in the publication firewall.
# See DECISIONS.md D-0025 and the local-only register in docs/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.bag/
bag-info.txt
bagit.txt
manifest-sha*.txt
tagmanifest-sha*.txt
license.pdf

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.eggs/

# Tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
